  "//browserslist": "Smart TVs are the floor here, not phones: webOS 6 is Chromium 79 and Tizen a similar vintage, and the default target compiles syntax neither of them parses. Raising it costs a few kilobytes on every other browser and is the difference between the TV routes running and a blank screen.",
